  "prefLabel": "Cla 214.03 Payments on Claims",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cla 214.03 Payments on Claims. Board orders authorizing the payment of claims shall be subject to the limitation on payments and interest on payments set forth in RSA 541-B:14, I through III.\n\nSource. #8509, eff 12-09-05",
